// Opponent AI pace lock-in (playtest row 99, docs/integration/opponent-pace.md): the
// lantern_checkpoint race from apps/simcli/scenarios/race/pick_lantern_checkpoint.ron,
// police off (no patrols, no presence), traffic as in the race, every seat (the player's
// too) driven by wp_opponent at skill 0.95, each seat's picker personality otherwise.
// simcli cannot drive AI racers: run standalone, the cars wait on the grid and the
// `expect_pending` pace metrics stay pending (unknown to simcli).
// crates/wp_race/tests/opponent_pace.rs::pace_scenarios_hold_their_ranges races it (release
// builds) and checks them: `finishers` (every car finishes), `best_ratio` (best time over
// that car's ideal time: its speed profile at 100 % of its measured limits; at most today's
// + 0.05, never under 0.97), `race_time_s` per car (today's time −15 % .. +15 %, +20 % at
// skill 0.50). Measured 2026-10-20 on lead/opponent-pace; re-measured the same day on the
// round-12 tip (today's grids, residential grid city, police give-way; reasons in
// docs/integration/opponent-pace.md). Re-measured 2026-10-21 on ws/police 3bccc796 (main's
// turn signals / give-way timing): the field now waits ~24 s behind a civilian turning at a
// give-way junction and the cross traffic after it (all four cars, best ratio 1.86).
// Re-locked 2026-10-21 on ws/police 3bccc796 + ws/harness + lead/round12 (one-version
// handling); reasons in docs/integration/opponent-pace.md. Re-measure and widen only with a reason.
// Re-locked 2026-10-21 on claude/awesome-faraday-epejyl (playtest row 134: traffic no longer
// emergency-brakes for a racer passing in the next lane): best ratio 2.286 (Juno 82.1 s), max 2.25 → 2.34 (+0.05).
// Re-locked 2026-10-22 when the pace harness moved to the browser setup (the player seat stays
// a player car, AI-driven, so traffic spawns round it): best ratio 2.248 -> 1.311, field
// faster: downtown traffic now spawns round the player car instead of all over the city (about 12 civilians within 300 m of each racer before), so the field meets less of it.
// Re-locked 2026-10-23 (bolder racers, docs/integration/opponent.md): ai_tito 49.5 s and
// player 50.6 s, faster than the old 52.7 / 53.7 s minimums; the other cars unchanged.
(
    name: "opponent_pace_lantern_checkpoint_s95",
    seed: 31,
    city: preset(
        name: "vesper_v2",
        seed: 1,
    ),
    time_of_day_h: 14.0,
    time_ratio: 1.0,
    mode: Simulation,
    assists: ai,
    traffic_density: 0.2,
    police_presence: 0.0,
    police_cars: false,
    panels: true,
    entities: [
        (
            id: "player",
            car: "lindwurm_4t",
            pos: (-1.75, 257.0, 13.628593),
            yaw: 3.1415927,
            driver: scripted,
            inputs: [],
        ),
        (
            id: "ai_juno",
            car: "shiro_turbo",
            pos: (-1.75, 233.0, 13.628593),
            yaw: 3.1415927,
            driver: scripted,
            inputs: [],
        ),
        (
            id: "ai_dez",
            car: "rampart_50",
            pos: (-1.75, 241.0, 13.628593),
            yaw: 3.1415927,
            driver: scripted,
            inputs: [],
        ),
        (
            id: "ai_tito",
            car: "sperber_32",
            pos: (-1.75, 249.0, 13.628593),
            yaw: 3.1415927,
            driver: scripted,
            inputs: [],
        ),
    ],
    duration_s: 10.0,
    sample_hz: 60.0,
    hash_every: 240,
    expect: [
        total_loss(
            entity: "player",
            expected: false,
        ),
        total_loss(
            entity: "ai_juno",
            expected: false,
        ),
    ],
    expect_pending: [
        metric(name: "finishers", min: 4, max: 4),
        metric(name: "best_ratio", min: 0.97, max: 1.36),
        metric(name: "race_time_s", entity: "ai_juno", min: 41.1, max: 55.6),
        metric(name: "race_time_s", entity: "ai_dez", min: 40.2, max: 54.3),
        metric(name: "race_time_s", entity: "ai_tito", min: 42.1, max: 56.9),
        metric(name: "race_time_s", entity: "player", min: 43.0, max: 58.1),
    ],
)
